CORE
main.py
--python-smt-containers --z3
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
^\[.*\] .* Python assertion: FAILURE$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
--
--
--python-smt-containers keeps the refined string representation. When the
SMT encoder could not lower startswith/contains/find/ordering of such
strings exactly, it emitted a constant (false, 0, -1 or "equal") and this
was proved (a false proof). The result is now an uninterpreted
application of the operation.
